org/t/p/original/11mGqwpmu8CoEy1YJgabj2g7MIv.jpg"},{"id":1105808,"name":"Tori Matsuzaka","role":"Beppo (voice)","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8JcMm3al3gySuay2EiW3CI19Apj.jpg"},{"id":79037,"name":"Kenichi Matsuyama","role":"L","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/j7zwtoLF6A7d8xSU9kjgz664nQw.jpg"},{"id":31078,"name":"Tatsuya Fujiwara","role":"Light Yagami","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/1nR5cYgh9SaA7fGdQAXznyqObPv.jpg"},{"id":1560393,"name":"Kensei Mikami","role":"Teru Mikami","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wI2KYEK1bnxbh3jn10vuhb9uuCw.jpg"}],"crew":[],"videos":[],"watchProviders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Death Note - Il film - Illumina il nuovo mondo","overview":"Dieci anni sono passati dall'ultima morte riconducibile all'uso del Death Note. Le conseguenze delle azioni di Light sono giunte agli occhi del Re degli Shinigami; affascinato dall'uso che ne hanno fatto gli uomini, il Dio della Morte fa sì che 6 Death Note giungano nel mondo dei mortali. Tre personaggi andranno alla ricerca del quaderno più letale di sempre, spinti dall'appello di Light a cercarli e a icarnare lo spirito del Dio del nuovo mondo: Kira. La follia delle morte torna a permeare il mondo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Death Note: Light Up the NEW World","overview":"10 years has passed since the confrontation between Kira and L. Again, Shinigami sends death notes to the ground and due to this, the world soon falls into chaos. Tsukuru is a member of the Death Note special task force team with 6 other investigators including Matsuda who experienced the Kira case of 10 years ago.  Mass murders caused by the death note takes place on Wall Street in the U.S., Shibuya in Japan and other places. World famous private investigator Ryuzaki, who is the rightful successor of L, also investigates the mass murders. They discover that 6 death notes exists in the world.  A computer virus called Kira spreads in the world. A message in the Kira virus says to turn in 6 death notes.  A person who has 6 death notes overwhelm the world. The confrontation begins between the person who wants Kira’s revival and the people who want to stop it."},{"language":"ja-JP","title":"デスノート Light up the NEW world","overview":"デスノートの力で多数の凶悪犯を破滅させた夜神月と、彼を追い詰めた天才Lの伝説のバトルから10年の歳月が経過。またしても死神がデスノートを下界にまき散らしたため、世界中が混乱していた。夜神総一郎が設立したデスノート対策本部は健在で、キラ事件を熟知する三島をはじめとする特別チームが事態を注視しており……。","tagline":"あの事件から10年ー　これで、すべてを終わらせる。"}],"images":{"logos":[{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ljlFb90Wob3wvTWQLj4unYxnuCb.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ljlFb90Wob3wvTWQLj4unYxnuCb.png","language":"en","width":513,"height":213},{"type":"logo","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jBdxeoxPF1LEMOvZi3vHUmvAXUU.png","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/jBdxeoxPF1LEMOvZi3vHUmvAXUU.png","language":"en","width":1275,"height":474}],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hHhiV9RjHpm9o2qwgBZw2MhriTg.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/hHhiV9RjHpm9o2qwgBZw2MhriTg.jpg","language":"it","width":500,"height":750},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cDBV5mIMc8h0dsRHF43rUUk3I0O.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cDBV5mIMc8h0dsRHF43rUUk3I0O.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/86plcu1GuGFddVNsgJtvi7S8Prk.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/86plcu1GuGFddVNsgJtvi7S8Prk.jpg","language":"en","width":1600,"height":2400},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kpFXVZBUeitycVVYTZJJsZ67Q1f.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kpFXVZBUeitycVVYTZJJsZ67Q1f.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zkKjFZwnBH5sJwt02RpfN8bqRUB.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/zkKjFZwnBH5sJwt02RpfN8bqRUB.jpg","language":"en","wi